   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> »titan« Becomes a Trailblazing 3D Pioneer </h1>",
   "body": "<p>With »3dCheck«, the ideal inspection machine for fast, process-oriented, and fully automatic digitization of tool geometries, you can measure non-contact—without causing damage to the tools.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3636\">3D Nominal/Actual Comparison</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3637\">3D Analysis</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3638\">2D Analysis</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/5/csm_anwendung_3dpionier_90e4c070c0.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1200
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1500",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/7/csm_topographie_de_fb85133d61.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "3D Nominal/Actual Comparison",
   "text": "<p>With color-coded labeling and weighting of geometric deviations across the entire tool surface. This allows for faster and more targeted intervention in the production process.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3636",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/0/csm_3D-analyse_de_bed5e1c93b.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "3D Analysis",
   "text": "<p>The scanned tool contour, with the option to insert defined cutting planes for continuing detailed 2D analysis. The 3D measurement data can be exported in the standard .stl format for further processing in the customer-specific CAD system.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3637",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/7/csm_2D-analyse_de_ac39ea6b3b.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 589
   },
   "title": "2D Analysis",
   "text": "<p>Displays the defined cutting plane as a 2D contour and enables a nominal/actual comparison, with color-coded and weighted deviations. Additional measurements can also be taken on the 2D contour for further analysis.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3638",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Smart 24/7 Presence </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>ZOLLER »roboSet 2« – automates your »titan«. Performs cleaning, loading, labeling, and organization of your tools completely without manual labor.</strong></p> <p><strong>All measurements are fully documented. After measurement, the tools are labeled using ZOLLER »roboMark«—a laser flexibly marks the tool shaft within milliseconds with values individually determined during the measuring process and other data.</strong></p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/automation/tool-inspection/roboset-2\">Learn more about »roboSet 2«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/2/csm_titan_roboset2_6f7b12a8e2.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1193
    }
   ],
