     "href": "/ca/solutions/inspection-measuring",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>Inspection &amp; Measuring: Your Advantages</h3> <p>Find out what is possible with ZOLLER for tool inspections. Process-related inspections or high-end analyses through to SKP, roughness and the creation of digital twins.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
